Moved a `@group-members` row behind `IGroupMemberSerializer`, a multi-adapter on the site and the request, so a deployment can add a field to a membership row by subclassing `GroupMemberSerializer` and registering it for its own browser layer. Adding a field previously meant replacing the service. It adapts the site rather than the brain because a brain carries no `__provides__` and cannot be marked, and the only registration a brain could carry would answer for every brain in the site. @ericof
